---
import Link from '@/components/ui/link.astro'
---

<div class="about">
  <div class="text">
    <h1>Elise Bayraktar</h1>
    <p>I am currently a postdoctoral researcher at Sorbonne Université (LPSM), working with Charlotte Dion-Blanc.</p>
    <p>
      I previously did my PhD at Université Gustave Eiffel under the supervision of Emmanuelle Clément on the "High-frequency estimation of the stable
      CIR model" [<Link href="https://theses.hal.science/tel-05517419">Hal</Link>], which I defended in July 2025. I was awarded the prize{' '}
      <Link href="https://www.sfds.asso.fr/fr/prix_et_bourses/544-le_prix_marie_jeanne_laurent_duhamel/">Marie-Jeanne Laurent-Duhamel</Link> 2026.
    </p>
    <p class="contact">
      Contact: <Link href="mailto:elise.bayraktar@sorbonne-universite.fr">elise.bayraktar@sorbonne-universite.fr</Link>
    </p>
  </div>
  <img
    alt="Portrait of Elise Bayraktar, postdoctoral researcher in probability and statistics at Sorbonne Université"
    decoding="async"
    fetchpriority="high"
    height="800"
    src="/images/profile-picture.webp"
    width="800"
  />
</div>

<style>
  .about {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .contact {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  img {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    width: 75%;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    border: 2px solid var(--primary);
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .about {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .text {
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .text {
      width: 75%;
      padding-right: 2rem;
    }
    img {
      margin-top: 0;
      width: 25%;
    }
  }
</style>
